# Feature 3 — Goal → Milestone → Habit Framework

## Problem

Many users lose motivation because habits feel disconnected.

## Solution

Create hierarchy:

```text
Vision
 ↓
Goal
 ↓
Milestone
 ↓
Habit
```

### Example

```text
Vision:
Become a Remote Backend Engineer

Goal:
Get a Remote Job

Milestone:
Build Portfolio

Habit:
Code 1 Hour Daily
```

Users can see:

```text
Today's habit contributes to:
Remote Backend Engineer Goal
```

This creates stronger emotional engagement.

