# Feature 5 — Failure Pattern Analysis

## Problem

Most habit trackers only record success.

They rarely analyze failure.

## Solution

When a habit is skipped:

Ask:

```text
Why did you miss this?
```

Options:

* Busy
* Forgot
* Low Energy
* No Motivation
* Schedule Conflict
* Other

### AI Analysis

After enough data:

```text
68% of missed habits occur after 9 PM.

You are significantly more successful
when completing this habit before lunch.
```

This creates unique behavioral intelligence.

